Price drift: 23 price rows are still wrong (down from 73 at v0.3.0): OpenAI 16, Z.ai 5, DeepSeek 1, Mistral 1. The release notes say so, and #1012 is cited as the owner. I posted the summary line and the full row list on #1012 rather than filing a duplicate, and I didn't edit the price table or the test.

Heads-up pings: I searched issues for "next release" and the 30 most recently updated discussions for release-ping promises, and found none. Nobody to ping.

One thing to watch: I pushed only the tag, as the task said. Main on origin is still two commits behind (765b192b), and the harness's end-of-session push will fast-forward it. If something else lands on main first and that push rebases, main would end up with a different commit than the one v0.4.0 points at.
